Recommends: khelpcenter-trinity
Description: AI chat client for the Trinity Desktop Environment
 TDE AI Client is a native Trinity (TDE) application for talking to AI
 language and image models.
 .
 It connects to the free, volunteer run AI Horde, to a KoboldCpp server on
 the same computer or in the local network, and to any service with an
 OpenAI-compatible API (OpenAI, OpenRouter, Ollama, llama.cpp and others).
 .
 Besides chatting it can have images generated and text read aloud. Files
 can be attached to messages: text, images, audio, video and other files
 are sent to the services and models that can handle them. Conversations
 are saved and can be exported.
 .
 This program is not affiliated with any of the services it connects to.
